[38;5;231m⏺[39m Added a basic checkbox to [38;5;153mindex.html:16-19[39m:

  - A [38;5;153m<label>[39m-wrapped [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m with the item text, so clicking either the box or the text toggles it.
  - The checkbox's native checked state is the on/off state — no JS needed.
  - One CSS rule strikes through the text when checked, so "done" is visible.

  No tests exist in this repo, and I didn't run anything beyond viewing the file. The item label is a placeholder ([38;5;153mTask
